<h2>Nine Ways to Read the Graph — Each View Answers a Different Question</h2>
<p>Even for the same knowledge graph, the right visualization depends on <strong>what you are curious about</strong>. The dock on the <a href="#!cosmos">Knowledge Graph</a> screen is two-stage — you first pick <strong>3D · 2D</strong> and then a view inside it (3D is the default) — and there are <strong>nine views</strong> in total. Each was chosen to answer one distinct question. This document lays out "what to look for in each view".</p>

